---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import KeyMotif from '../components/KeyMotif.astro';
import Placeholder from '../components/Placeholder.astro';
import ivaPortrait from '../assets/people/iva-portrait.jpg';

const education = [
  { title: 'PhD in Christian Spirituality', place: 'Milltown Institute, Dublin' },
  { title: 'MA in Classical Christian Spirituality', place: 'Milltown Institute, Dublin' },
  { title: 'Diploma in Spiritual Direction', place: 'Manresa Jesuit Retreat House' },
  { title: 'BA in Philosophy and Religious Culture', place: 'Jesuit Faculty, Zagreb' },
];
---
<BaseLayout title="About" description="Dr Iva Beranek: spiritual director, retreat leader and writer, founder of I Arise Ministry.">
  <section class="bg-parchment">
    <div class="container-page grid items-center gap-12 py-16 md:grid-cols-[7fr_5fr] md:gap-20 md:py-24">
      <div>
        <KeyMotif class="text-gold-deep" size={72} />
        <p class="eyebrow mt-6 text-restoration-deep">Founder</p>
        <h1 class="mt-3 text-5xl text-midnight md:text-7xl">Dr Iva Beranek</h1>
        <p class="measure mt-6 text-xl text-ink-soft">Retreat leader, spiritual director and writer.</p>
      </div>
      <figure class="relative mx-auto w-full max-w-sm">
        <div class="absolute -right-4 -bottom-4 h-full w-full rounded-t-full bg-coral/35" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <Image src={ivaPortrait} alt="Dr Iva Beranek, smiling, with long auburn hair." widths={[360, 540, 720]} sizes="(min-width: 768px) 34vw, 90vw" class="relative aspect-[4/5] w-full rounded-t-full object-cover object-top" loading="eager" />
      </figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Iva's own words (supplied by Iva, 13 Nov 2026). Keep her wording. -->
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24" aria-labelledby="why-title">
    <div class="container-page">
      <article class="mx-auto max-w-2xl">
        <p class="eyebrow text-restoration-deep">My story</p>
        <h2 id="why-title" class="mt-3 text-4xl text-midnight md:text-5xl">Why I started I Arise Ministry</h2>
        <div class="prose-page mt-8">
          <p>When people ask me why I started I Arise Ministry, the answer is deeply personal.</p>
          <p>Like you, I’ve known deep pain, loss and healing, and I’ve discovered something that has changed my life: pain doesn’t have to be the end of the story. With God, it can become the beginning of something new. That’s why my ministry is called I Arise, inspired by St Patrick, whose life was transformed from slavery into becoming Ireland’s patron saint.</p>
          <p>I believe every person is created in God’s image. Your soul is like a diamond within you, declaring your dignity. But life’s wounds can make us forget who we are.</p>
          <p>My desire is to create spaces where people can encounter God’s love afresh, rediscover their dignity and grow in prayer: not by escaping their pain, but by allowing God to meet them within it.</p>
          <p>One sentence has become the heart of my ministry:</p>
        </div>
        <p class="my-12 text-center font-display text-4xl italic leading-tight text-restoration-deep md:text-5xl">Underneath all pain, joy is hidden.</p>
        <div class="prose-page">
          <p>Healing is painful, but when we walk with God, it is possible, and we can arise into the fullness of who we were created to be. As we heal, we also uncover good things that have been buried within us. You might have dreams that you were too afraid to pursue, perhaps even a new calling that will not only enrich your life, but the world too.</p>
          <p>You are deeply loved. And you are capable of a deeper transformation than you currently believe. Come on a journey with me, and with God, and discover more that God has for you.</p>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-8 font-display text-3xl italic text-midnight">Iva</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="container-page grid gap-16 border-t border-midnight/10 py-16 md:py-24 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_20rem]">
    <article class="prose-page measure">
      <h2 class="!mt-0">A little more about me</h2>
      <p>I grew up in Croatia and came to Dublin in 2005 to study. Ireland became home. My PhD explored how people and communities heal from painful memories, with a focus on Northern Ireland.</p>

      <h2>My ministry</h2>
      <p>I lead retreats, prayer days and talks in parishes and universities across Ireland and abroad, and I am a trained spiritual director.</p>
      <Placeholder label="To confirm with Iva">Which of her 2021 roles are still current?</Placeholder>

      <h2>Writing and radio</h2>
      <p>My reflections have been heard on RTÉ Radio 1. I write articles, poems and children’s books, including <a href="/books/">Veronica’s Bookstore</a>.</p>

      <h2>Beyond work</h2>
      <p>I love nature, and photographing Dublin’s urban foxes.</p>
    </article>

    <aside class="space-y-10">
      <section aria-labelledby="edu-title">
        <h2 id="edu-title" class="text-3xl text-midnight">My studies</h2>
        <ul class="mt-6 space-y-5 border-l border-gold-deep/40 pl-5">
          {education.map((e) => (
            <li>
              <p class="font-display text-xl leading-snug text-midnight">{e.title}</p>
              <p class="text-ink-soft">{e.place}</p>
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </section>
      <div class="rounded-2xl bg-midnight p-7 text-ivory on-dark">
        <p class="font-display text-2xl leading-snug">Journey with me</p>
        <a href="/journey/" class="btn btn-light mt-6 w-full">Ways to begin</a>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
